    ///
    /// # Header encoding
    ///
    /// ```text
    ///   0   1   2   3   4   5   6   7
    /// +---+---+---+---+---+---+---+---+
    /// | 1 |        Index (7+)         |
    /// +---+---------------------------+
    /// ```
